Scan loops: set cells 1 to 5 to 1 and cell 7 to 1 then scan right from 1 and then left
>+>+>+>+>+>>+<<<<<<   back to cell 1
[>]                   stops at cell 6
++++++[<++++++++>-]<. cell 5 becomes 49: print '1'
[<]                   cells 4 to 1 are 1 so stop at cell 0
>>.                   cell 2 is still 1: print byte 1
